.godot/
*.translation
rust/target/
# Built libraries (debug and *_release) are platform-specific and large (debug 150–300 MB each,
# release ~23 MB per platform and commit): built by tools/build.* (--release / --all),
# never committed. Ship them in release archives instead. The addon and Phantom Camera submodules
# ignore their own bin/ too (the path below is kept for a non-submodule checkout).
addons/MarchingSquaresTerrain/bin/
tests/captures/
# Godot's atomic saves leave <file>.tmp behind when interrupted.
*.tmp
# Demo-only player controller library (built by tools/build.*).
demo/bin/
